.SS "void * schultz_windows_clipboard_owner (void * window)"

.PP
The window handle to own the clipboard with\&. Windows would rather a window owned the clipboard than the bare task, and the handle lives inside SDL's window\&.
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIwindow\fP The SDL_Window, as a void pointer\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The handle, or NULL\&. 
.RE
